R -> C: getAllActiveSessionsController()
note right of C: Không tìm thấy thân hàm getAllActiveSessionsController
S -> MSession: save()
MSession --> S: result
S -> MFlashCardProgress: findOne()
MFlashCardProgress --> S: result
S -> MFlashCardProgress: find()
MFlashCardProgress --> S: result
S -> MFlashCardAttempt: create()
MFlashCardAttempt --> S: result
S --> C: response
C --> R: JSON
R --> User: HTTP GET /active-by-user response

'=== GET /:session_id ===
